  "body_html": "<p>name: 8mm<br />date: 2010-01-10<br />type: live act<br />event: n/a</p>\n<p>city: Torres Vedras, Portugal<br />place: Teatro-Cine Torres Vedras</p>\n<p>client: Teatro-Cine Torres Vedras<br />collaboration: Ruben Santos, Telmo Martins, Bruno Henriques</p>\n<p>description PT: Live Act de performance musical com cinema, projecção de 8mm.</p>\n<p>links:</p>\n<div id=\"embedpress_wrapper_5npsg\" class=\"embedpress_wrapper wpview wpview-wrap\" style=\"width: 589px;\" data-loading-text=\"Loading your embed...\" data-uid=\"5npsg\" data-url=\"embedpresss://vimeo.com/9282189\">\n<div id=\"embedpress_controller_panel_5npsg\" class=\"embedpress_controller_panel embedpress_ignore_mouseout hidden\">\n<div id=\"embedpress_button_edit_5npsg\" class=\"embedpress_ignore_mouseout embedpress_controller_button\">\n<div class=\"embedpress-icon-pencil embedpress_ignore_mouseout\"><a class=\"embedpress_ignore_mouseout\" href=\"https://vimeo.com/9282189\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"hidden embedpress_ignore_mouseout\">&amp;nbsp;</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"embedpress_button_remove_5npsg\" class=\"embedpress_ignore_mouseout embedpress_controller_button\">\n<div class=\"embedpress-icon-x embedpress_ignore_mouseout\"><a class=\"embedpress_ignore_mouseout\" href=\"https://vimeo.com/9282189\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"hidden embedpress_ignore_mouseout\">&amp;nbsp;</span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"embedpress-wrapper ose-vimeo ose-uid-42ac1c09d8c3ca8e8c85dc5c1bc9efc0 responsive\" style=\"max-width: 589px;\"><iframe title=\"8mm #1\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/9282189?app_id=122963\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>a performance designed for opening a screening of Dziga Vertov's \"Man with Movie Camera\", commissioned by ATV and Teatro-Cine TV.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The music is fully made in realtime, by sampling the 8mm projector with piezos and a zoom h4n, and then looping and modulating the audio.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This performance is somehow a stage zero of a more complex and longer performance i want to do in the near future, based on the same principle.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Concept, sound mangling and multicam edit:<br>Rui Gato</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Men with video cameras:<br>Ruben Santos<br>Telmo Martins<br>Bruno Henriques</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Production:<br>Gonçalo Oliveira - ATV</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
